# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
dist/

# OS files
.DS_Store

# Logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Camera and export masters.
#
# This repo already follows a derivative convention: the site serves
# web-sized files (DSC02121-web.jpeg at 350 KB, artist-work-video.mp4,
# Jimmy Luna Show Header.mp4) and those are what is committed. The
# originals they were made from -- 17 MB camera JPEGs, a 183 MB 4K MOV --
# sit alongside them and are not referenced by app/src at all.
#
# They were never meant to be committed: two exceed GitHub's 100 MB hard
# limit, and this is a public Pages site, which is capped at 1 GB
# published. Ignoring them keeps `git status` honest instead of showing
# 444 MB of masters as pending work every time.
#
# Keep the masters -- they are the source for any future re-export. They
# are just not repository content.
app/public/project media/**/DSC*.jpeg
!app/public/project media/**/DSC*-web.jpeg
app/public/project media/**/*.MOV
app/public/project media/**/*.mov
app/public/project media/K-Pops!/
app/public/project media/Sinners/
app/public/project media/Jimmy/01 - Jimmy Luna Show Header.mp4
